<h1>Example document</h1>
<p>This document shows what Markdown Editor can do. Open it in the app to see
the editor and the live preview side by side, or read it here: GitHub
renders the same Markdown.</p>
<p>To try it in the app, download this file (on GitHub: <em>Download raw
file</em>) and open it with <em>File &gt; Open</em>.</p>
<h2>Text</h2>
<p>Paragraphs can contain <strong>bold</strong>, <em>italic</em>, <em><strong>bold italic</strong></em>,
<del>strikethrough</del> and <code>inline code</code>. A line that ends with a backslash<br>
continues on a new line.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A quote can contain <em>formatting</em></p>
<blockquote>
<p>and other quotes.</p>
</blockquote>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2>Lists</h2>
<ul>
<li>Bullet points
<ul>
<li>can be nested
<ul>
<li>several levels deep</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>and continue afterwards</li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li>Numbered lists</li>
<li>count on their own
<ol>
<li>and can be nested as well</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
<h2>Tasks</h2>
<p>In the app, a click on a checkbox in the preview checks or unchecks the
task: exactly the character between the brackets changes in the editor,
and ⌘Z undoes it.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="markdown-preview://task/snapshot/0" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true" aria-label="Task"><input type="checkbox" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" checked=""></a> Install Markdown Editor</li>
<li><a href="markdown-preview://task/snapshot/1" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true" aria-label="Task"><input type="checkbox" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" checked=""></a> Open this document</li>
<li><a href="markdown-preview://task/snapshot/2" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Task"><input type="checkbox" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></a> Check this task in the preview
<ul>
<li><a href="markdown-preview://task/snapshot/3" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Task"><input type="checkbox" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></a> Nested tasks work as well</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="markdown-preview://task/snapshot/4" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Task"><input type="checkbox" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"></a> Press ⌘Z to undo</li>
</ul>
